OL,3,GNEWSAEverton and Liverpool legends in
OL,4,Ahomeless charity match
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegends from Everton and Liverpool FC
OL,7,Fwill put their rivalries aside to play
OL,8,Fa charity football match later this
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe Game4Hope will take place at Hill
OL,12,FDickinson Stadium on 26 September to
OL,13,Fraise money for Shelter and Everton in
OL,14,Fthe Community, to help people affected
OL,15,Fby homelessness in the Liverpool City
OL,16,FRegion.
OL,18,FMerseyside XI will feature the likes of
OL,19,FRobbie Fowler, Leighton Baines, Gareth
OL,20,FBarry, and John Aldridge, under the
OL,21,Fjoint management of Peter Reid and John
OL,22,FBarnes.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
