OL,3,GNEWSAEverton and Liverpool legends in
OL,4,Ahomeless charity match
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will play against a Rest of the
OL,7,FWorld XI side which includes Brazil's
OL,8,FWorld Cup-winning captain Cafu, as well
OL,9,Fas Champions League winners Clarence
OL,10,FSeedorf and Jaap Stam.
